            "review_title": "Review at Hang 66 - Seafood Nha Trang",
            "review_text": "Сергей Н\n1 contribution\n0\nNot recommended, very poor service\nSep 2024 • Friends\nA disgusting stumble, a long wait for the meal, even though the place was half empty, during which time they saw that a table was served to the visitors who came later than us. Cheated with a check, twice turned on the dish we've been waiting for the longest, which was shrimp in a bucket. After removing the clare, you could see the shrimp was poorly cleaned. Not recommending this place, cheating and poor service, there are plenty of more honest establishments\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten September 26, 2024",
